{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh6ZrRJiTVBcNnriv6gX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ReportingService depends directly on two services, and through them on two APIs, one more service and three databases. I queried the dependency graph at depth 4, then one hop at a time to get the shape below.\n\n**Dependency tree**\n\n```\nReportingService\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 BillingService            (DEPENDS_ON)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 BillingPostgresDatabase   (STORES)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 NotificationsAPI          (CALLS)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 OrderService              (DEPENDS_ON)  \u2190 same node as below\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 OrderService              (DEPENDS_ON)\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 OrdersPostgresDatabase    (STORES)\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 PaymentsAPI               (CALLS)\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 UserService               (DEPENDS_ON)\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500 UsersPostgresDatabase     (STORES)\n```\n\n**Everything it depends on**\n\n- **Direct services:** BillingService, OrderService\n- **Indirect service:** UserService (through OrderService)\n- **APIs:** NotificationsAPI (through BillingService), PaymentsAPI (through OrderService)\n- **Databases:**\n  - BillingPostgresDatabase (through BillingService)\n  - OrdersPostgresDatabase (through OrderService)\n  - UsersPostgresDatabase (through OrderService \u2192 UserService)\n\n**Notes**\n\n- ReportingService reaches OrderService two ways: directly, and through BillingService. If OrderService has a problem, both of ReportingService's direct dependencies are affected, so it's the most important one to watch.\n- NotificationsAPI and PaymentsAPI have no dependencies of their own in the graph, so the tree stops there.\n- The graph doesn't link any configuration keys to these dependency edges. The dependency tool doesn't follow configuration links, though, so to check a specific key you'd need to run `trace_configuration` on it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 704, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4626, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 704}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "f0133bed-4e60-4822-8001-eee40ae92644", "uuid": "52ed809e-dcac-45ed-adfe-651bf257eadb", "timestamp": "2026-11-04T02:26:46.298Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgh6Zr9hJN26KB4WzJYKW"}
